  "captions": [
    {
      "a": 0.641,
      "b": 2.273,
      "text": "One hunter, or a colony?"
    },
    {
      "a": 3.065,
      "b": 5.098,
      "text": "Trace that pale line through the water."
    },
    {
      "a": 5.929,
      "b": 8.061,
      "text": "Where would you say one animal ends and"
    },
    {
      "a": 8.073,
      "b": 9.123999999999999,
      "text": "the next begins?"
    },
    {
      "a": 10.645,
      "b": 13.656999999999998,
      "text": "Look at this photograph from a dive off Puerto Rico."
    },
    {
      "a": 14.506999999999998,
      "b": 15.498,
      "text": "Start at the tip."
    },
    {
      "a": 16.288,
      "b": 18.82,
      "text": "Follow the row of clear bells down to the bend."
    },
    {
      "a": 20.240000000000002,
      "b": 22.031000000000002,
      "text": "See how the pattern changes there?"
    },
    {
      "a": 22.902,
      "b": 24.933,
      "text": "If these were just links in a chain,"
    },
    {
      "a": 25.203,
      "b": 27.735000000000003,
      "text": "you'd expect the next link to do the same thing."
    },
    {
      "a": 29.126,
      "b": 30.337000000000003,
      "text": "Here's the surprise."
    },
    {
      "a": 31.189,
      "b": 33.422000000000004,
      "text": "A siphonophore grows as a colony."
    },
    {
      "a": 34.253,
      "b": 36.92700000000001,
      "text": "The repeating parts are animals called zooids,"
    },
    {
      "a": 37.157000000000004,
      "b": 38.509,
      "text": "and they stay attached."
    },
    {
      "a": 39.77,
      "b": 41.401,
      "text": "Watch a swimming bell squeeze."
    },
    {
      "a": 42.252,
      "b": 44.022000000000006,
      "text": "Water shoots out of the opening."
    },
    {
      "a": 44.813,
      "b": 47.202,
      "text": "The push moves the bell and carries its"
    },
    {
      "a": 47.214,
      "b": 48.545,
      "text": "neighbors along with it."
    },
    {
      "a": 49.816,
      "b": 53.21000000000001,
      "text": "Farther down the stem, a tentacle trails in the water."
    },
    {
      "a": 54.081,
      "b": 55.99400000000001,
      "text": "Its stinging cells can catch prey."
    },
    {
      "a": 56.845000000000006,
      "b": 59.819,
      "text": "A feeding zooid has the mouth that takes the meal in."
    },
    {
      "a": 61.150999999999996,
      "b": 62.803,
      "text": "So where does one hunter end?"
    },
    {
      "a": 63.675,
      "b": 66.569,
      "text": "You can pick out the individual swimmers and feeders."
    },
    {
      "a": 67.401,
      "b": 69.755,
      "text": "But follow a meal or a single stroke,"
    },
    {
      "a": 70.005,
      "b": 72.319,
      "text": "and you're watching the whole colony at work."
    }
  ],
  "events": {
    "question": 0.641,
